      <title>岚图取消梦想家9预售发布会 卢放直指营销内卷</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek001/post/20260904/%E5%B2%9A%E5%9B%BE%E5%8F%96%E6%B6%88%E6%A2%A6%E6%83%B3%E5%AE%B69%E9%A2%84%E5%94%AE%E5%8F%91%E5%B8%83%E4%BC%9A-%E5%8D%A2%E6%94%BE%E7%9B%B4%E6%8C%87%E8%90%A5%E9%94%80%E5%86%85%E5%8D%B7/</link>
